      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "First, sit down in a quiet, well-lit area and take deep breaths to help with the lightheadedness. Try closing your eyes for a little while to let your eyes rest. If needed, gingerly move your eyes around to different angles to help reset the sensitivity, but be careful not to overdo it. Avoid sudden movements and make sure you're in a safe space where you won't fall if you get dizzy again. Do you need specific assistance, like work tasks help or next steps after your shift?",
