      "content": "i get that but i really need to focus and the pressure in my head is making it impossible. id really rather just deal with it myself with something i already have in my cabinet. would taking like a bunch of vitamin b or maybe some extra strength aspirin help with the pressure? i just need to get through the next 4 hours.",
